  "Retrieve and analyze AlphaFold predicted structures for a protein. Use when the user provides a specific UniProt Accession ID and wants structural confidence metrics (pLDDT), domain boundary analysis, or disorder assessment. Do not use if the user only has a protein name, gene name, or amino acid sequence \u2014 ask for a UniProt ID first.": "\u68c0\u7d22\u5e76\u5206\u6790 AlphaFold \u86cb\u767d\u8d28\u4e09\u7ef4\u9884\u6d4b\u7ed3\u6784\u6a21\u578b\u3002\u6839\u636e UniProt Accession ID \u5206\u6790\u7ed3\u6784\u7f6e\u4fe1\u5ea6 (pLDDT)\u3001\u7ed3\u6784\u57df\u8fb9\u754c\u53ca\u65e0\u5e8f\u533a\u57df\u3002",
